1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Car hesitates when you step

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
on the gas?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
A little stumble on acceleration,

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
maybe a rough idle at a stoplight.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
One clue: a dirty airflow sensor.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
It can send the wrong signal about how much air is coming in.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
That can throw off the fuel mix —

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
engine hesitates instead of responding.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess which part it is.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A scan tool can help narrow it down.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it gets worse.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
